{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_st02","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_st02","title":"冲破藩篱","storyCode":"OF-ST2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st02.txt","sourceHash":"a48d6a265eecf7256fddb2fceaa5c8e5c8c77f2bce89ec115b768fa0a1d3809f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最后，根据同位素的对比情况以及多种样本的最终分析，基本可以确认你们的猜想是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火山活动频率确实处于一个异常的爬升状态，虽然不至于马上爆发天灾，但是并不能对其视而不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火山活动应该会在二至四周之内到达临界点，之后就会引起火山天灾的爆发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能的话，最好马上安排市民进行避难准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......以上，就是根据你们给出的情报得出的结论。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是艾雅法拉，隔着联络竟然也能整整说了40分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你听懂了吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什么都没说一样。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得，反应过来的时候好像就结束了。"}]},{"label":"嗯，结论我懂。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，博士真厉害，我完完全全没有听明白......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"看那边那两个人的样子，我还以为只有我听不懂呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是艾雅法拉，连我都重新上了一课呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，不愧是专家，收集的这些数据原来还能从这个方向解读。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到在这里能够学到这样的知识，天哪，我应该全部用笔记下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然目前情报还比较有限，不过我的判断和你们是一样的，这座火山很有可能已经从休眠状态进入了活化状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我不在现场，没办法对于火山的活动原因进行进一步的探索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，如果有更多的现场情报我们甚至能找到火山活动的契机，更精确地确定活动的周期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果那样的话也能方便市民们做好转移安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都明白你对火山的执着，艾雅法拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经帮了我们大忙了。辛苦你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"有你们这样专业的团队帮助我进行确认实在是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因为仪器的问题，汐斯塔的观测点一直都读不出任何数据异常来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"看来为此我的东奔西走还是值得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得赶快把这些消息带给市政府才行，不然后果肯定不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思不会是说，汐斯塔市在这个时候举办了如此大规模的节日活动，却一点天灾的准备都没有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"现在别说准备了，市民和游客甚至连天灾有可能产生都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我父亲在三个月前前往新开发区进行工作了，要在几天后才能回来，现在城里大大小小的事情都交给了他的秘书克洛宁处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"而克洛宁也是这座城市的天灾信使，我们只需要现在回去市政府，带回数据和其他样本，就可以让他了解情况了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我是市长的女儿，但是关于城市政府的事情我并没有太多参与。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在既然已经得到了确实的证明，就可以让家里的人帮助我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我有一个想法，我去火山进一步确认情况，我想试着找一找艾雅法拉提到的契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"锡兰这边能拜托你和其他人吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"进入火山？那也太危险了？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾信使的工作总是危险的，放心吧，在这方面我还是很有经验的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然远程通讯只能在旅馆进行，不过我会随时和博士保持联络的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我也和你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什么意见？我可不放心，万一你破坏了重要的研究数据怎么办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然是要跟你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，没有意见没有意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，我们需要通知一下阿米娅吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"不用啦。小事一桩而已，有博士知道就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此那我们就说定了，博士。也请你准备一下资料，我们下午两点就出发去市政厅。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没问题。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，事情定下来后，总算可以稍微放松一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我这里有一些从维多利亚带来的茶叶，来喝一杯茶吧。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好吧。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你一定会喜欢的。"}]},{"label":"不必了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"是不会泡茶吗？那我亲手帮你泡一杯吧。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好吧。","value":"4","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，我想你一定会喜欢的。"}]},{"label":"......不必了。","value":"5","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"真是个麻烦的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是在维多利亚中数一数二的茶叶哦？"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"败给你了。","value":"6","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了，我想你一定会喜欢的。"}]},{"label":"............不必了。","value":"7","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我的泡茶手艺可是很好的，不尝一下会抱憾终身哦？"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"...................好吧。","value":"8","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"真是个顽固的人，非要我这么说才能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，请稍等片刻。"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普罗旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["锡兰"]}]}
